==Bulgarian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|bg|la|biblia}} or directly from {{der|bg|grc|βιβλία||books}}, ultimately from {{m|grc|βίβλος||book}}, a variant of {{m|grc|βύβλος||papyrus}}. The word is derived from the name of the Phoenician city [[Byblos]], which was known for exporting papyri in ancient times.

===Pronunciation===
* {{bg-IPA|би́блия}}
